The copied NAVSIM subset is limited to scene loading, scenario construction,
metric-cache construction, PDM evaluation/simulation, and traffic policies.
DiffusionDrive, Parallel-IR, and RWM files are reduced to model
architecture, sensor preprocessing, checkpoint loading, and inference.
Optimizers, losses, training loops, callbacks, notebooks, and visualization
code are not included.
